age 0 projects the job's upper bound from its measured seconds per evaluation times eval_cap times the searches. band_min: E242's (E226's) fallback when the split-half band is 0. Exact zeros, no tolerance: o_F recomputed from the module's input equals the module's output bit for bit; every gain at an unchanged site is exactly 1 and its variables stood in give KL exactly 0; all kept gives F's logits exactly; on the do-nothing every gain is exactly 1 and every variable stood in gives KL exactly 0. Amended 2026-11-21 before any scored run (sae-lead, after the rehearsal, job 62745): shard_hours_max 2 -> 6. The projection prices every search at the cap at the do-nothing's 512-window speed (0.88 s per K* and 1.23 s per stand-in evaluation, about 4.9 h per built item), so 2 h stopped every job; the copy-window items run at 0.21 s (about 56 min at the cap, inside the debug 2 h --time), and new_few and new_thin run on H100 pods, where 6 h is the gated-run limit. No rule, band or prediction changed."}
